        "@value": "Liars at a Funeral"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Liars at a Funeral, the PREMIERE of this classic comedy style play by Sophia Fabiilli at Memorial Hall. Part of the Blyth Festival 2023 summer season."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Liars at a Funeral \n\nWORLD PREMIERE\nWritten by Sophia Fabiilli; Directed by Krista Jackson\nMemorial Hall\n\n\n\nThe hilarious story of a grandmother who fakes her own death in a last-ditch hope to get her dysfunctional family in one room, but with catering and bouquets.\n\nFull of classic farce gags (Who’s in the casket? Who’s in the closet? Who’s"
      }
    ],
